# The inputs of packaging/requirements-release.txt, which the release workflow installs with
# --require-hashes. Versions are exact: a bump is an edit here and a regeneration, reviewed.
# Regenerate (never hand-edit the .txt), from the repository root, with `make requirements-release`. The
# .txt's header records pip-compile's own command line, whose `--no-index` and `=None` options are
# cosmetic (unset options, not what ran): do not paste that command, run the make target.
